ason:  \nYou have two pair (8s and 4s), which can beat weak one-pair hands or bluff-catch. Folding to a small river bet would overfold, but raising risks more with marginal strength. Calling realizes equity and keeps the pot manageable while staying in the lead.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
