on, equity, and risk.\n\nReason:  \nYou have a strong flush draw with 9 outs (~36% chance to hit by river), plus backdoor straight potential. Raising to 1116 applies pressure, may win the pot immediately, and builds the pot while you’re likely behind but drawing to the best hand. It’s a balanced, aggressive play consistent with your leading position and maximizes expected value.\n\nAnswer: 1116'}
